spice
* Components
R1 N1 V- R1_value
R2 V1 N1 R2_value
RF Vout N2 RF_value
RP N1 0 Rp_value

* Voltage Sources
V1 V1 0 DC V1_value
V2 N1 0 DC V2_value

* Operational Amplifier
* Assume an ideal op-amp with positive terminal grounded and gain A
E1 N2 0 N1 0 A

* Node Mapping
* V1 = Node 1
* V2 = Node 3
* X  = Node 3
* Vout = Node 2

* End of Netlist